{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the path no one would walk. Believe in what was lost. Some truths are buried where only the high-hearted dare step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cLegendary Tales: Map of Hope\u201d is an adventure game in the Hidden Objects genre, with plenty of mini-games and puzzles, unforgettable characters, and complicated quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucia and her brother have spent years running and hiding from witches, with nowhere left to turn. But their old friend Skarlett brings news that dispels the looming despair: there may be a place where they can finally reunite with their own kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, Skarlett cannot join the journey. The risk of exposing herself among the witches is far too great. Lucia must walk this path alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, as ever, she and her brother won\u2019t be truly alone. Along the way, they\u2019ll find allies\u2014some familiar, some unexpected\u2014each helping them inch closer to that distant dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they finally find peace among their kindred?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Prove that the legends are true</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore the magic world and its forgotten secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gather fascinating collections and find dozens of morphing objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy stunning locations and beautiful soundtracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solve dozens of puzzles and test your skills in exciting mini-games</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801470?t=1758264472","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801470/21c6794017a0bb6be52b1f5b3592607b871336c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758264472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801470/316d534ac00b545716ebb7b11582eebb6fcd15cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=175826